From ec2ac92887052bef7721863820a7f8985e05465e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Oct 2025 10:02:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: stm32: enable the debug bus on stm32mp1x boards

On stm32mp1x boards, enable the debug bus so we always try to probe
the debug peripherals, if the debug configuration allows it.

Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I0a72321d25f98adf9e356a6a188a8ed2e1c33a6a
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/500608
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp135f-dk.dts   | 4 ++++
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp157a-ev1.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp157c-ev1.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp157d-ev1.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp157f-ev1.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp15xx-dkx.dtsi | 4 ++++
 6 files changed, 24 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp135f-dk.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/st/stm32mp135f-dk.dts
@@ -197,6 +197,10 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&dbg_bus {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &dcmipp {
 	status = "okay";
 	pinctrl-names = "default", "sleep";
